+### Provenance of Supplementary Data S1
+
+`Supplementary_Data_S1_Gilbert_trefoil_record.xml` is a third-party Fourier
+record of the trefoil, redistributed verbatim so that the Fourier branch of the
+provenance analysis can be reproduced. Its origin, version, retrieval date and
+licence are recorded in the XML header and **must be completed before
+submission**; the filename currently carries an attribution ("Gilbert") that no
+longer appears anywhere in the manuscript. Either restore a citation or state in
+the text that the origin could not be established.
+
+The record is diagnostic only. No scalar result in the article depends on it:
+the metadata length is used for the Fourier branch, and the reconstructed
+geometry is used only for the curvature and writhe diagnostics reported in the
+appendix.
+
+Any edit to the XML changes its SHA-256. After editing, regenerate and verify:
+
+```bash
+sha256sum * > SHA256SUMS.txt
+sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt
+```
